    // Centrocamp: SX   CSX  CDX  DX     ← ZONA DOMINANTE Milinkovic+Luis Alberto
    32, 115, 108, 28,
    // Centroatt:  SX   CSX  CDX  DX     ← trequarti, Felipe Anderson + Immobile
